    <title>Long term data from the Hanko Bird Observatory (Halias data)</title>
      <pubDate>
      2022-02-15
      </pubDate>
    <language>FINNISH</language>
    <abstract>
        <para>Daily counts of the Hanko Bird Observatory  include following data types since year 1979: (i) counts of local staging birds, (ii) counts of visual diurnal migration, (iii) standardized visual migration counts, (iv) additional observations outside the core observation area, and (v) counts of night migration.</para>
    </abstract>
